ui/editor/diff — third-party notice
===================================

The algorithms of this package follow the design of Monaco Editor's
DefaultLinesDiffComputer (npm package monaco-editor@0.56.0,
esm/vs/editor/common/diff/): the line hashing, the dynamic-programming and
Myers alignments, the sequence heuristics (including their thresholds and
boundary scores), character-level refinement, move detection and the
unchanged-region rule of the diff editor. The Go code is written for this
package rather than translated line by line.

testdata/monaco/cases.json is generated by testdata/monaco/gen.mjs, which
runs Monaco's DefaultLinesDiffComputer and records its results.

